{
  "cells": [
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Structured Outputs: JSON, Schema Validation, Constrained Decoding Notebook\n\n> Hands-on Build It and Exercises."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Build It"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 1: JSON Schema Validator"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Build a validator from scratch that checks whether a Python object matches a JSON Schema. This is what runs on the output side to verify compliance."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "import json"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def validate_schema(data, schema):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    errors = []"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    _validate(data, schema, \"\", errors)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return errors"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def _validate(data, schema, path, errors):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    schema_type = schema.get(\"type\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    if schema_type == \"object\":"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if not isinstance(data, dict):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            errors.append(f\"{path}: expected object, got {type(data).__name__}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            return"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        for key in schema.get(\"required\", []):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            if key not in data:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                errors.append(f\"{path}.{key}: required field missing\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        properties = schema.get(\"properties\", {})"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        for key, value in data.items():"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            if key in properties:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                _validate(value, properties[key], f\"{path}.{key}\", errors)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    elif schema_type == \"array\":"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if not isinstance(data, list):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            errors.append(f\"{path}: expected array, got {type(data).__name__}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            return"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        min_items = schema.get(\"minItems\", 0)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        max_items = schema.get(\"maxItems\", float(\"inf\"))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if len(data) < min_items:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            errors.append(f\"{path}: array has {len(data)} items, minimum is {min_items}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if len(data) > max_items:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            errors.append(f\"{path}: array has {len(data)} items, maximum is {max_items}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        items_schema = schema.get(\"items\", {})"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        for i, item in enumerate(data):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            _validate(item, items_schema, f\"{path}[{i}]\", errors)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    elif schema_type == \"string\":"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if not isinstance(data, str):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            errors.append(f\"{path}: expected string, got {type(data).__name__}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            return"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        enum_values = schema.get(\"enum\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if enum_values and data not in enum_values:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            errors.append(f\"{path}: '{data}' not in allowed values {enum_values}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    elif schema_type == \"number\":"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if not isinstance(data, (int, float)):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            errors.append(f\"{path}: expected number, got {type(data).__name__}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            return"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        minimum = schema.get(\"minimum\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        maximum = schema.get(\"maximum\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if minimum is not None and data < minimum:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            errors.append(f\"{path}: {data} is less than minimum {minimum}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if maximum is not None and data > maximum:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            errors.append(f\"{path}: {data} is greater than maximum {maximum}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    elif schema_type == \"boolean\":"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if not isinstance(data, bool):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            errors.append(f\"{path}: expected boolean, got {type(data).__name__}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    elif schema_type == \"integer\":"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if not isinstance(data, int) or isinstance(data, bool):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            errors.append(f\"{path}: expected integer, got {type(data).__name__}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 2: Pydantic-Style Model to Schema"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Build a minimal class-to-schema converter. Define a Python class and generate its JSON Schema automatically."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "class SchemaField:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def __init__(self, field_type, required=True, default=None, enum=None, minimum=None, maximum=None):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.field_type = field_type"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.required = required"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.default = default"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.enum = enum"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.minimum = minimum"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.maximum = maximum"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def python_type_to_schema(field):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    type_map = {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        str: \"string\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        int: \"integer\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        float: \"number\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        bool: \"boolean\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    schema = {}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    if field.field_type in type_map:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        schema[\"type\"] = type_map[field.field_type]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    elif field.field_type == list:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        schema[\"type\"] = \"array\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        schema[\"items\"] = {\"type\": \"string\"}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    elif isinstance(field.field_type, dict):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        schema = field.field_type"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    if field.enum:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        schema[\"enum\"] = field.enum"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    if field.minimum is not None:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        schema[\"minimum\"] = field.minimum"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    if field.maximum is not None:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        schema[\"maximum\"] = field.maximum"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return schema"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def model_to_schema(name, fields):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    properties = {}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    required = []"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    for field_name, field in fields.items():"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        properties[field_name] = python_type_to_schema(field)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if field.required:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            required.append(field_name)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"type\": \"object\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"properties\": properties,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"required\": required,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 3: Constrained Token Filter"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Simulate constrained decoding. Given a partial JSON string and a schema, determine which token categories are valid at the current position."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def next_valid_tokens(partial_json, schema):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    stripped = partial_json.strip()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    if not stripped:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return [\"{\"]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    try:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        json.loads(stripped)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return [\"<EOS>\"]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    except json.JSONDecodeError:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        pass"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    last_char = stripped[-1] if stripped else \"\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    if last_char == \"{\":"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return ['\"', \"}\"]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    elif last_char == '\"':"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if stripped.endswith('\":'):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            return ['\"', \"0-9\", \"true\", \"false\", \"null\", \"[\", \"{\"]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return [\"a-z\", '\"']"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    elif last_char == \":\":"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return [\" \", '\"', \"0-9\", \"true\", \"false\", \"null\", \"[\", \"{\"]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    elif last_char == \",\":"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return [\" \", '\"', \"{\", \"[\"]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    elif last_char in \"0123456789\":"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return [\"0-9\", \".\", \",\", \"}\", \"]\"]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    elif last_char == \"}\":"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return [\",\", \"}\", \"]\", \"<EOS>\"]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    elif last_char == \"]\":"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return [\",\", \"}\", \"<EOS>\"]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    elif last_char == \"[\":"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return ['\"', \"0-9\", \"true\", \"false\", \"null\", \"{\", \"[\", \"]\"]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    else:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return [\"any\"]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def demonstrate_constrained_decoding():"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    partial_states = ["
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        '',"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        '{',"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        '{\"product\"',"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        '{\"product\":',"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        '{\"product\": \"Sony\"',"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        '{\"product\": \"Sony\",',"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        '{\"product\": \"Sony\", \"price\":',"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        '{\"product\": \"Sony\", \"price\": 348',"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        '{\"product\": \"Sony\", \"price\": 348}',"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    ]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    print(f\"{'Partial JSON':<45} {'Valid Next Tokens'}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    print(\"-\" * 80)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    for state in partial_states:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        valid = next_valid_tokens(state, {})"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        display = state if state else \"(empty)\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        print(f\"{display:<45} {valid}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 4: Extraction Pipeline"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Combine everything into an extraction pipeline: define a schema, simulate an LLM producing structured output, validate the output, and handle retries."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def simulate_llm_extraction(text, schema, attempt=0):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    if \"headphones\" in text.lower() or \"sony\" in text.lower():"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if attempt == 0:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            return '{\"product\": \"Sony WH-1000XM5\", \"price\": 348.00, \"in_stock\": true, \"categories\": [\"audio\", \"headphones\"]}'"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return '{\"product\": \"Sony WH-1000XM5\", \"price\": 348.00, \"in_stock\": true}'"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    if \"laptop\" in text.lower():"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return '{\"product\": \"MacBook Pro 16\", \"price\": 2499.00, \"in_stock\": false, \"categories\": [\"computers\"]}'"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return '{\"product\": \"Unknown\", \"price\": 0, \"in_stock\": false}'"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def extract_with_retry(text, schema, max_retries=3):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    for attempt in range(max_retries):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        raw = simulate_llm_extraction(text, schema, attempt)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        try:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            data = json.loads(raw)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        except json.JSONDecodeError as e:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            print(f\"  Attempt {attempt + 1}: JSON parse error -- {e}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            continue"
